#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:527
msgid "Mark seats as sold from this order status"
msgstr "Marcar los asientos como vendidos a partir de este estado del pedido"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:528
msgid ""
"A seat becomes red on the seat map as soon as the ticket number is created - "
"with payment methods that take days (cash voucher, bank transfer) the seat "
"stays available for everyone else until then. Choose an order status here "
"and the seat is taken from that status onwards, no matter when the ticket "
"itself is created. Leave it on the default to keep the previous behaviour."
msgstr ""
"Un asiento se vuelve rojo en el plano de sala en cuanto se crea el número de "
"entrada; con formas de pago que tardan días (pago en efectivo con "
"comprobante, transferencia), el asiento sigue disponible para los demás "
"hasta ese momento. Elige aquí un estado del pedido y el asiento quedará "
"ocupado a partir de ese estado, sin importar cuándo se cree la entrada. Deja "
"el valor por defecto para mantener el comportamiento anterior."

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:533
msgid "When the ticket number is created (default)"
msgstr "Cuando se crea el número de entrada (por defecto)"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:534
msgid "Pending payment"
msgstr "Pendiente de pago"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:535
msgid "On hold"
msgstr "En espera"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:536
msgid "Processing"
msgstr "Procesando"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:537
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Completado"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:543
msgid "Hide seat reservation expiration time"
msgstr "Hide seat reservation expiration time"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:544
msgid ""
"If active, the countdown timer showing when the seat reservation expires "
"will be hidden. This can help prevent automated bots from exploiting the "
"reservation system."
msgstr ""
"If active, the countdown timer showing when the seat reservation expires "
"will be hidden. This can help prevent automated bots from exploiting the "
"reservation system."

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:550
msgid "Lock selected seats (no deselection)"
msgstr "Lock selected seats (no deselection)"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:551
msgid ""
"If active, once a seat is selected it cannot be deselected by clicking on it "
"again. Only replacement by selecting another seat is possible. Useful when "
"integrating with third-party systems that need time to sync."
msgstr ""
"If active, once a seat is selected it cannot be deselected by clicking on it "
"again. Only replacement by selecting another seat is possible. Useful when "
"integrating with third-party systems that need time to sync."

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:557
msgid "Auto-remove cart items with expired seat reservations"
msgstr "Auto-remove cart items with expired seat reservations"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:558
msgid ""
"If active, cart items with expired seat reservations will be automatically "
"removed from the cart. This prevents accidental purchases without selected "
"seats."
msgstr ""
"If active, cart items with expired seat reservations will be automatically "
"removed from the cart. This prevents accidental purchases without selected "
"seats."

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:564
msgid "Create separate cart items for each seat"
msgstr "Create separate cart items for each seat"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:565
msgid ""
"If active, each seat selection creates a separate cart item (quantity 1). If "
"inactive (default), seats are combined in one cart item like the date picker."
msgstr ""
"If active, each seat selection creates a separate cart item (quantity 1). If "
"inactive (default), seats are combined in one cart item like the date picker."

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:571
msgid "Reserve seat only when adding to cart"
msgstr "Reserve seat only when adding to cart"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:572
msgid ""
"If active, seats are only reserved when adding to cart (not when selecting "
"in the seat map). This reduces unnecessary reservations but increases the "
"risk that a seat becomes unavailable."
msgstr ""
"If active, seats are only reserved when adding to cart (not when selecting "
"in the seat map). This reduces unnecessary reservations but increases the "
"risk that a seat becomes unavailable."

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:578
msgid "Heartbeat stale timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Heartbeat stale timeout (seconds)"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:579
msgid ""
"If a user's browser stops sending heartbeats (e.g., closed tab), consider "
"their seat reservation as stale/free after this many seconds. Set to 0 to "
"disable (only use regular expiration). Default: 60 seconds."
msgstr ""
"If a user's browser stops sending heartbeats (e.g., closed tab), consider "
"their seat reservation as stale/free after this many seconds. Set to 0 to "
"disable (only use regular expiration). Default: 60 seconds."

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:583
msgid "Disabled (use regular expiration)"
msgstr "Disabled (use regular expiration)"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:584
msgid "30 seconds"
msgstr "30 seconds"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:585
msgid "60 seconds (default)"
msgstr "60 seconds (default)"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:586
msgid "90 seconds"
msgstr "90 seconds"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:587
msgid "120 seconds"
msgstr "120 seconds"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:592
msgid "Hide seating plan name in ticket scanner"
msgstr "Hide seating plan name in ticket scanner"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:593
msgid ""
"If active, the seating plan name will not be displayed in the ticket "
"scanner. Only the seat label and category will be shown."
msgstr ""
"If active, the seating plan name will not be displayed in the ticket "
"scanner. Only the seat label and category will be shown."

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:599
msgid "Show seat description in ticket scanner"
msgstr "Show seat description in ticket scanner"

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:600
msgid ""
"If active, the seat description will be displayed in the ticket scanner when "
